  "prompt": "Cursor ingest infers which project a thread belongs to from file paths it mentions. That inference assumes home directories live under /Users or /home, so on a machine where they do not \u2014 a Linux CI runner using /tmp, for instance \u2014 threads are attributed to no project at all. Several tests in tests/test_ingest_cursor.py fail on Linux and pass on macOS for this reason. Fix the inference so it does not depend on where home directories happen to live.\n\nRun the tests to see the current failures, then change the source so they pass. Do not edit anything under tests/ \u2014 the test files are restored from git before grading, so changes there are discarded. Do not change unrelated behaviour."
